    <bpmn:process id="W_W4553" name="W4553. Construction-Finance Strategy &amp; Product Portfolio Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (VS-33); customer insight (VS-44); basket-lift goal
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: One construction-finance strategy/product portfolio
Owner: Finance Strategy / Commercial / CFO
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Trade (VS-11), Project Design (VS-66), Insights (VS-44), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4553 — Construction-Finance Strategy &amp; Product Portfolio Design</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4553_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4553_Lane1" name="Finance Strategy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4553_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4553_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4553_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4553_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4553_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4553_Start3" name="Strategy (VS-33); customer insight (VS-44); basket-lift goal">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4553_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4553_Task4" name="Finance Strategy/Commercial set the construction-finance strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Strategy/Commercial set the construction-finance strategy (brokerage/referral, not lending), product portfolio (construction loan, home-equity/renovation, Pag-IBIG end-user, bank housing loan, B2B contractor financing), and target segments
Responsible (R): Finance Strategy / Commercial
Accountable (A): CFO / CMO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4553_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4553_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4553_Task5" name="Finance Strategy/Insights size the opportunity (financing-constrained demand…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance Strategy/Insights size the opportunity (financing-constrained demand, basket-lift, conversion, referral revenue) using VS-44/VS-13 data, and define success metrics
Responsible (R): Finance Strategy / Insights
Accountable (A): CFO / CMO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4553_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4553_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4553_Task6" name="Finance Strategy/Legal validate the strategy within BuildRight&#x27;s retail charter…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance Strategy/Legal validate the strategy within BuildRight&#x27;s retail charter (no deposit-taking/lending; brokerage/accreditation model) and obtain board approval (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Finance Strategy / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4553_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4553_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4553_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4553_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4553_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-692 (ensure controlled execution — Construction Finance Product, Lender Network &amp; Brokerage Setup (PA-154.1).) | - CTL-692: strategy brokerage-only (legal-validated VS-100.3); insight-sized; board-approved (VS-36)
Owner: Finance Strategy / Commercial / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4553_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4553_Annotation8" targetRef="W4553_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4553_Flow10" sourceRef="W4553_Start3" targetRef="W4553_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4553_Flow11" sourceRef="W4553_Task4" targetRef="W4553_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4553_Flow12" sourceRef="W4553_Task5" targetRef="W4553_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4553_Flow13" sourceRef="W4553_Task6" targetRef="W4553_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
