    <bpmn:process id="W_W4554" name="W4554. Lender/Partner Network Development (Banks, Pag-IBIG, Financing Companies)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4553); network expansion; partner review
Frequency: Per partner + periodic review
Volume: Lender partner network (universal/thrift banks, Pag-IBIG, financing companies)
Owner: Commercial / Finance Strategy / Procurement (VS-34)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Compliance (VS-22), Trade (VS-11), Risk (VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W4554 — Lender/Partner Network Development (Banks, Pag-IBIG, Financing Companies)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4554_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4554_Lane1" name="Commercial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4554_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4554_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4554_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4554_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4554_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4554_Start3" name="Strategy (W4553); network expansion; partner review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4554_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4554_Task4" name="Commercial/Finance Strategy build the lender-partner network (banks for housing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Commercial/Finance Strategy build the lender-partner network (banks for housing loans, Pag-IBIG for end-user financing, financing companies for contractor/renovation loans), screened for BSP-licensure/solvency
Responsible (R): Commercial / Finance Strategy / Risk
Accountable (A): CFO / CMO
Duration: Per partner</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4554_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4554_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4554_Task5" name="Commercial/Legal negotiate partnership/MOU (referral terms, commission W4570…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Commercial/Legal negotiate partnership/MOU (referral terms, commission W4570, data exchange, SLA, branding), with due diligence (VS-34/VS-03) and compliance (VS-22)
Responsible (R): Commercial / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Per partner</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4554_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4554_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4554_Task6" name="Commercial/Risk manage the partner portfolio (performance, solvency, conduct)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Commercial/Risk manage the partner portfolio (performance, solvency, conduct), renew/exit (VS-67), and ensure competitive coverage across regions/segments
Responsible (R): Commercial / Risk
Accountable (A): CFO / CMO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4554_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4554_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4554_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4554_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4554_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-692 (ensure controlled execution — Construction Finance Product, Lender Network &amp; Brokerage Setup (PA-154.1).) | - CTL-692: lenders BSP-licensed/solvent (VS-22); partners DD&#x27;d (VS-34); portfolio diversified; conduct monitored (VS-67)
Owner: Commercial / Finance Strategy / Procurement (VS-34)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4554_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4554_Annotation8" targetRef="W4554_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
