    <bpmn:process id="W_W4556" name="W4556. Loan Product Terms, Eligibility &amp; Pricing Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Product design (W4553); lender term change; review
Frequency: Per product + periodic
Volume: Loan-product terms/eligibility framework across the portfolio
Owner: Finance Strategy / Commercial / Lenders
Participants: Pricing (VS-01.2), Trade (VS-11), Insights (VS-44), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4556 — Loan Product Terms, Eligibility &amp; Pricing Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4556_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4556_Lane1" name="Finance Strategy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4556_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4556_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4556_Lane2" name="Commercial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4556_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4556_Lane3" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4556_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4556_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4556_Start5" name="Product design (W4553); lender term change; review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4556_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4556_Task6" name="Finance Strategy/Lenders define product terms (loan amount, tenor, rate range…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Strategy/Lenders define product terms (loan amount, tenor, rate range, collateral, fees) and eligibility (income, credit, property, project scope) per product, aligned to lender criteria
Responsible (R): Finance Strategy / Lenders / Pricing
Accountable (A): CFO / CMO
Duration: Per product</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4556_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4556_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4556_Task7" name="Commercial/Insights set the BuildRight customer offer (bundled…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Commercial/Insights set the BuildRight customer offer (bundled materials/services, preferential terms via partner, project-size thresholds) and pricing linkage (VS-01.2/VS-38)
Responsible (R): Commercial / Insights / Pricing
Accountable (A): CMO / CFO
Duration: Per product</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4556_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4556_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
