Responsible (R): Risk / Finance Strategy
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4557_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4557_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
