Owner: IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / Finance Strategy
Participants: Data (VS-28), Security (VS-27.3), Privacy (VS-91), Lenders
Source: workflow W4560 — Systems, Data Privacy &amp; Integration Architecture</bpmn:documentation>
