      <bpmn:userTask id="W4560_Task6" name="IT/EA/Finance Strategy design the systems architecture (customer application…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/EA/Finance Strategy design the systems architecture (customer application, pre-qualification scoring, lender integration, draw-milestone tracking, commission), per VS-113
Responsible (R): IT / EA / Finance Strategy
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4560_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
