      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4560_Task7" name="Privacy/Security ensure customer financial-data privacy (consent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Privacy/Security ensure customer financial-data privacy (consent, purpose-limit, secure lender exchange) per RA 10173 (VS-91) and security (VS-27.3)
Responsible (R): Privacy / Security / IT
Accountable (A): DPO / CIO
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4560_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4560_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4560_Task8" name="Data/Finance Strategy build referral/loan analytics (conversion, basket-lift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Data/Finance Strategy build referral/loan analytics (conversion, basket-lift, referral revenue, default correlation) on the platform (VS-28), with data governance
Responsible (R): Data / Finance Strategy
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4560_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4560_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
